an class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$HM=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{entry-1-1}}</td><td>{{entry-1-2}}</td><td>{{entry-1-3}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{entry-2-1}}</td><td>{{entry-2-2}}</td><td>{{entry-2-3}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{entry-3-1}}</td><td>{{entry-3-2}}</td><td>{{entry-3-3}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "$H$ has ones on its diagonal and zeros elsewhere, so $H=I_3$. Both matrices are $3 \\times 3$, so the product is defined. Multiplication by the corresponding identity leaves every entry unchanged.\n\n$$\nHM=M=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 6 & -6 \\\\ 3 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 5 & -5 & -4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFor example, its first entry is $1\\cdot(3)+0\\cdot(3)+0\\cdot(5)=3$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719400 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8f8706d5-fbcf-593b-9a48-72c35f858d13" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719386}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8f8706d5-fbcf-593b-9a48-72c35f858d13" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719386} :answer-field/id #uuid "77e739d2-7e43-5ea2-83cb-20965f96493b" :answer-field/key "entry-1-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719379} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a3c12ddc-40c5-559c-aa3a-3bd8989b6749" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719396}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a3c12ddc-40c5-559c-aa3a-3bd8989b6749" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719396} :answer-field/id #uuid "8daab360-a89b-56af-8635-b478ed4768bf" :answer-field/key "entry-2-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/r