</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$ME=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{entry-1-1}}</td><td>{{entry-1-2}}</td><td>{{entry-1-3}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{entry-2-1}}</td><td>{{entry-2-2}}</td><td>{{entry-2-3}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{entry-3-1}}</td><td>{{entry-3-2}}</td><td>{{entry-3-3}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "$E$ has ones on its diagonal and zeros elsewhere, so $E=I_3$. Both matrices are $3 \\times 3$, so the product is defined. Multiplication by the corresponding identity leaves every entry unchanged.\n\n$$\nME=M=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -5 & -2 \\\\ -5 & -6 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFor example, its first entry is $(3)\\cdot1+(-5)\\cdot0+(-2)\\cdot0=3$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719622 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1d6163ec-0bb7-5a4b-b379-e604ec8839bb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719616} {:answer/id #uuid "55665bbe-f9d4-5ec2-a2f0-8388f80431fa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719625} {:answer/id #uuid "668b57f5-935f-5de4-a4ab-f5fe42d984f6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719629} {:answer/id #uuid "6d69c73c-19f3-5e61-bbaa-c421738c78c4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719630} {:answer/id #uuid "f89b865b-acb5-5a5a-9aba-702a3021e82a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719646}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1d6163ec-0bb7-5a4b-b379-e604ec8839bb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719616} :answer-field/id #uuid "59353e0d-dacf-541f-a465-2a52c7d1564d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719626}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "3fa778f8-9ad6-5505-9711-40ee1362351d" :question/problem "Find the product $AB$, if\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The matrix $B$ is column $2$ of $I_3$. Multiplying on the right selects column $2$ of $A$:\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nCheck the entries by row-by-column multiplication:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\cdot 0+(0)\\cdot 1+\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\cdot 0&=0 \\\\ (0)\\cdot 0+(1)\\cdot 1+(0)\\cdot 0&=1 \\\\ \\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\cdot 0+(0)\\cdot 1+\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\cdot 0&=0\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719628 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2f680b52-0377-56bb-b50d-7fd4d5a5cba3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719619} {:answer/id #uuid "3ea6bcde-d4b6-545c-b364-8f4eec9f4780" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3.5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719621} {:answer/id #uuid "c46e176a-97ac-508a-824f-856459501c9d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719639} {:answer/id #uuid "ed8a5a98-c56a-5913-b418-b75f58bc7078" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719644} {:answer/id #uuid "fdc8e2ba-4d27-5ec8-ad89-5007fb895d1c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719647}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c46e176a-97ac-508a-824f-856459501c9d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719639} :answer-field/id #uuid "2dcc2d87-fdc6-5512-8291-70870399fd0a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719618}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "610431da-471a-5a7d-84b4-2a87f220851f" :question/problem "Find the product $AB$, if\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 8 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 8 & 4 \\\\ 3.5 & 8 & -8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The matrix $B$ is column $2$ of $I_3$. Multiplying on the right selects column $2$ of $A$:\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nCheck the entries by row-by-column multiplication:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(7)\\cdot 0+(8)\\cdot 1+(2)\\cdot 0&=8 \\\\ (0)\\cdot 0+(8)\\cdot 1+(4)\\cdot 0&=8 \\\\ (3.5)\\cdot 0+(8)\\cdot 1+(-8)\\cdot 0&=8\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
